{"chapter-slug":"rw6-44 E","paragraph":1064,"wording":"[Summer Knight]","event":"named","holder-slug":"ser-raim","holder-quote":"The [Summer Knight] followed her. He paused just once. Talia’s eyes burned and ran with tears. He put a hand out, touching her shoulder gently.","id":"8094f0a4-b12c-5bf2-8c83-cfd4ec8ce2e3"}
{"chapter-slug":"rw6-44 E","paragraph":1070,"wording":"[Summer Knight]","event":"named","holder-slug":"ser-raim","holder-quote":"A voice came from the orb. But the [Summer Knight] walked on. He passed by Ryoka, and she studied him.","id":"3632bc16-aa7f-568f-8260-b7f05a4330a2"}
{"chapter-slug":"rw6-45 E","paragraph":829,"wording":"[Summer Knight]","event":"named","id":"da583dc1-e0a9-5a97-809c-ea023d637908"}
{"chapter-slug":"rwInterlude - Talia","paragraph":4,"wording":"[Summer Knight]","event":"named","holder-slug":"talia-kallinad","holder-quote":"Rhir had roads only behind the walls. If the Demons had roads, well, Talia Kallinad had never heard. Surely they must. But the [Summer Knight], elder sister to Wil Kallinad and potentially heir to the Kallinad family if she married, had never visited Rhir. Someday she would. As a member of the Order of Seasons, she had sworn to champion righteous causes and fight monsters and evil wherever she found it.","id":"5b7a2764-6ff2-5f59-baa4-756ca5cd5f50"}
{"chapter-slug":"rwInterlude - Talia","paragraph":8,"wording":"[Summer Knight]","event":"named","holder-slug":"talia-kallinad","holder-quote":"Long, and painful. She glanced to one side and saw a flash of silver and green. A [Knight] rode to her left. Not a [Summer Knight] as she was, but a fellow member of the Order of Seasons. He was a [Spring Knight], sworn to the Season of Spring.","id":"92814226-2c47-5d64-a7bb-a828bfd572d1"}
{"chapter-slug":"rwInterlude - Talia","paragraph":47,"wording":"[Summer Knight]","event":"named","holder-slug":"ser-lorell","holder-quote":"Lorell cautioned the young man as some of the other Spring Knights shouted agreement. The others looked at him. The [Summer Knight] looked unhappy as he shook his head.","id":"380bbcb1-558d-5f75-8d7a-ac215044067e"}
{"chapter-slug":"rwInterlude - Talia","paragraph":94,"wording":"[Summer Knight]","event":"named","id":"8114f067-f81e-53ed-ad01-193ba1e1412e"}
