{"chapter-slug":"rwInterlude - Talia","paragraph":150,"wording":"[Summer Knight]","event":"named","holder-slug":"ser-lorell","holder-quote":"“This is more than just a lone raid, Ser Lorell.”","id":"fe1e05d9-37d1-5dd2-aa4f-e0ab87345e26"}
{"chapter-slug":"rwInterlude - Talia","paragraph":183,"wording":"[Summer Knight]","event":"named","holder-slug":"dame-chise","holder-quote":"“We shall, then. Dame Chise, will you aid our speed?”","id":"bb212ce0-cb95-55c3-9a77-9957240cdc39"}
{"chapter-slug":"rwInterlude - Talia","paragraph":194,"wording":"[Summer Knight]","event":"named","holder-slug":"ser-lorell","holder-quote":"The enraged man waved a fist at Ser Lorell. Caught off-guard, the [Summer Knight] hesitated, and then moved his horse out of the way. The Order of Seasons parted, and the [Farmer] rolled past them. They stared at him as he glared.","id":"b37ad63d-f87d-553b-a1e2-ca436a2fb5b7"}
